    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD FULL GAME TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is the free prologue to <strong><i>Cult Of Babel</i></strong> - A roguelite Horde Survivors with dungeon crawling elements. This Prologue lets you access the first area of the game. Select your mighty steampunk witch or wizard, get the ancient cards of power and slaughter the horde of evil cultists guarding the tower of babel.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/4edfa82633df56f1ef89eccac2a0f788.webp?t=1664130969\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced horde survival gameplay<br></li><li>Play as one of the legendary sorcerers<br></li><li>Get magic cards to upgrade your steampunk wizard's arsenal<br></li><li>Zany Synergies<br></li><li>Quick, 15 min sessions for quick fun</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/8d28f97732e3659f4c74f569119f45ff.avif?t=1664130969\" /></div><br><br>In this roguelite, arena survival game, the randomized cards you get change how you play the game completely. Become a thunder mage, control gravity and much more !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/500feb592e51de13daeb2b873a321269.poster.avif?t=1664130969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/500feb592e51de13daeb2b873a321269.webm?t=1664130969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/500feb592e51de13daeb2b873a321269.mp4?t=1664130969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/faeb054aa16aa503bbf09da726f2fcdd.avif?t=1664130969\" /></div><br><br>60+ cards to collect and upgrade ! The more cards you have in your deck, the more their effects combine and enable you to unleash the fury of ancient magic.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/8c3f62b84d367e0c43dc9b61c92781d2.avif?t=1664130969\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/bc19d935b33716dbdec68f13d0eb74c2.poster.avif?t=1664130969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/bc19d935b33716dbdec68f13d0eb74c2.webm?t=1664130969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/bc19d935b33716dbdec68f13d0eb74c2.mp4?t=1664130969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/21a3b64951b9057ce5c2ff04e26f3860.poster.avif?t=1664130969\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/21a3b64951b9057ce5c2ff04e26f3860.webm?t=1664130969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/21a3b64951b9057ce5c2ff04e26f3860.mp4?t=1664130969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101600/extras/9b2043176d3af68d7298200580d4a0cb.avif?t=1664130969\" /></div><br><br>Play as one of the legendary sorcerers ! There are many characters to choose from each run.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn